  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 1st level, a kineticist chooses one primary element on which to focus. This element determines how they access the raw power of the Ethereal Plane, and grants them access to specific wild talents (see below) and additional class skills. They can select any element normally available to a kineticist<sup>OA</sup>. They gain their selected element’s basic utility wild talent (such as basic telekinesis, basic aerokinesis, basic geokinesis, basic pyrokinesis, or basic hydrokinesis) as a bonus wild talent. See Elements for the specific abilities granted by each element.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/legendary-kineticist#toc2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
